  exerciseNumber: 11
  exerciseName: EnemyShootingItself
  exerciseTitle: Enemy shooting itself
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458776
  exerciseText: Enemy is shooting itself instead of the Player
  hintText: What is the find target logic doing? Is it really checking for the Player?
  solutionText: Enemy find target logic is just checking for HealthSystem instead
    of Player. Since the enemy also has a Health System it attacks itself.
